 csv.\nNote: West Bengal Government 2026 holiday list. UNESCO: the eyes are
  painted onto the clay images on Mahalaya.\nhttps://par.wb.gov.in/holidayl
 ist.php\nMore: https://buildwith.curiosta.com/experiences/kumartuli-durga-
 puja-kolkata/
URL:https://par.wb.gov.in/holidaylist.php
CATEGORIES:Watch,Event
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
